---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Fonts from '../components/Fonts.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import YearReveal from '../components/YearReveal.astro';
import SiteScripts from '../components/SiteScripts.astro';
---
<Base lang="en">
<Fragment slot="head">
<meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Blog — Travel Guides for South Florida | Onyx Executive Miami</title>
<meta name="description" content="Practical guides on airport transfers, private aviation, and executive travel across Miami, Fort Lauderdale, and Palm Beach, from Onyx Executive Miami." />
<link rel="canonical" href="https://onyxexecmiami.com/blog.html" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0A0A0A" />
<Fonts />
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": "South Florida Executive Guide",
  "url": "https://onyxexecmiami.com/blog.html",
  "publisher": {
    "@id": "https://onyxexecmiami.com/#business"
  }
}
</script>
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://onyxexecmiami.com/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Blog"
    }
  ]
}
</script>
</Fragment>
<SiteHeader current="blog.html" mobileCurrent="blog.html" />

<section class="page-hero">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Blog</p>
<p class="eyebrow on-dark">Blog</p>
<h1 class="display">Guides for getting around South Florida.</h1>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p class="lead">Practical notes on airports, private aviation, and executive travel — written from the driver's seat, not a listicle mill.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="blog-grid reveal">
<a class="post-card" href="blog-sunny-isles-restaurants.html">
<div class="thumb"><img src="aventura-chauffeur-pickup.webp" width="700" height="933" alt="Onyx chauffeur pickup near Sunny Isles Beach" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
<div class="body">
<div class="no">01</div>
<h3>Where to Eat in Sunny Isles Beach</h3>
<p>Special-occasion dinners, sushi, Mediterranean grills, and where to go when dinner turns into a late night out.</p>
<div class="more">Read →</div>
</div>
</a>
<a class="post-card" href="blog-miami-airports-guide.html">
<div class="thumb"><img src="chauffeur-meet-and-greet.webp" width="700" height="875" alt="Onyx chauffeur holding a name sign in a Miami airport arrivals hall" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
<div class="body">
<div class="no">02</div>
<h3>Miami Airports: MIA vs. FLL vs. PBI/DJT</h3>
<p>Which South Florida airport to fly into, and how transfer time actually compares between them.</p>
<div class="more">Read →</div>
</div>
</a>
<a class="post-card" href="blog-private-chauffeur-vs-rideshare.html">
<div class="thumb"><img src="bag-handoff.webp" width="700" height="872" alt="Onyx chauffeur handing a passenger her bag curbside in Miami" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
<div class="body">
<div class="no">03</div>
<h3>Private Chauffeur vs. Uber and Lyft in Miami</h3>
<p>A factor-by-factor comparison — pickup, flight tracking, pricing, luggage, and which situations favor each option.</p>
<div class="more">Read →</div>
</div>
</a>
<a class="post-card" href="aventura-transportation-guide.html">
<div class="thumb"><img src="miami-skyline-aerial.webp" width="600" height="338" alt="Aerial view of the Miami skyline near Brickell at sunset" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
<div class="body">
<div class="no">04</div>
<h3>Aventura Transportation Guide</h3>
<p>Airports, hotels, the mall, and what to do with kids by age — all in the Aventura corridor.</p>
<div class="more">Read →</div>
</div>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap">
<h2 class="h2">Planning a trip?</h2>
<p>Call or message for a fixed quote across any South Florida airport.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+17869316699">Call +1 786 931 ONYX (6699)</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html#book">Request a quote</a></div>
</div></section>
<SiteFooter />
<div class="mbar"><a href="tel:+17869316699">Call</a><a href="https://wa.me/17869316699?text=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20quote." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a></div>
<YearReveal />
<SiteScripts />
</Base>
